WEBVTT

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.790
Don't just stand there quietly; say something!

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:12.930
Hey!

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.100
Why, you...

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.900
C'mon, take it easy.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:22.060
Okay, gramps, we only want
to know the truth here.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.430
Are you going to tell us or what?

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.750
A little more to the right!

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.050
Oh, that's too far!

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.960
Left! To the left!

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.520
Oh, you're no use.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.690
Shaddup!

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.160
How 'bout we take a little break?

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.530
Yeah, no kidding!

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:46.300
We've been working hard since this morning.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.770
Isn't there stuff we gotta do besides
fixing up the shop?

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.100
You really are children, you know.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:51.970
What'd you say?!

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:56.010
It's times like this when you especially
need light and cheer.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.810
We just want to bring people a nice,
warm place to be.

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:00.610
Volunteer work like this...

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:02.780
...isn't so bad.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.620
It will dry out my hands though.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.120
You're a monster.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.220
A nice, warm place, huh?

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:09.290
All right, then!

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.960
I'll help you with all my might!

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.590
Well, I am going to charge money, you know.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:16.060
Wait... Big Mama?

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:21.530
Why, you! Gimme back those tears!

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:28.570
How's it going with the curtain?

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:29.570
Well...

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:32.080
I think we could use about another
ten meters, maybe.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.910
Well, let's see what Misato has to say, okay?

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.900
And how about the podium?

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.750
How about that podium?

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:44.320
Oh, I guess we'll manage.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:47.160
There's way more wood than we
need lying around, and all.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.960
I'm counting on you.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.190
Sakurai?

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.870
Hey, Anko, how's it going?

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:58.040
All right, I guess.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:59.500
How about you?

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.730
I'll go once I'm done with this.

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:05.210
Only two more weeks, huh?

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:07.010
We've gotta hang in there.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.290
It's nice we're able to use the gas again.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.590
Definitely!

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:17.020
Food is the source of vitality after all.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:18.660
How does this taste?

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.450
Oh, thanks...

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.520
Ah, it's great.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:28.920
Story of the Golden Dragon ~
Cherry Blossoms That Do Not Fall
The Tenth Night
Stars of Fate Chapter

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.940
Tatsuma!

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.920
Kyouichi!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.490
Tatsuma!

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.960
Aoi!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.180
The kids have been searching for you.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.440
You're so popular!

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.240
Typical for you.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:19.580
Everyone's so stressed out, not being
able to find their moms or dads.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.520
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.620
We were the lucky ones.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:29.900
My family and Anko's and
Kyouichi's families were all okay.

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:34.420
Now, your dad and the others are back in
Japan to help out with rebuilding.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.790
It really is like a miracle.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.100
But...

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:43.000
But Hiyu...

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:50.620
Plus, most all of our classmates and
teachers at Magami didn't make it.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:55.710
And no one's heard from Daigo's dad either.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:00.980
I'm looking forward to our graduation.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.130
Anko's sure full of enthusiasm for it too.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.030
I've gotta do my best to keep up.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.830
Please do.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.470
Everyone at the shelter is
looking forward to it too.

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.670
They want to have a celebration at the end.

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.510
It will be a month late,

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:22.610
but our time here will be over pretty soon.

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.780
It's all gone by in a flash.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.320
The battle was over, and then we came back here.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:31.290
And there were all these people
coming here for shelter.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.620
Yeah...

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.390
We had injured people, sick people,

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:38.000
Iow-lives coming to give us trouble...

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.170
But lately things have calmed down a bit.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.900
It almost makes wonder if we could just stay here.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:49.840
Well, we can't do that now that a
proper shelter has been built.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:53.010
Yeah, I know.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.810
But still, it's kinda like...

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.250
Yeah...

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.620
And still others have left Tokyo.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:01.420
And there are lots of children
who have lost their parents.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:05.990
That's why we have to make this
graduation ceremony work,

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.930
for their sakes too!

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.550
Right!

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.030
Say, Aoi...

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:15.000
Yeah?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.900
Is it really over?

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.110
It's over, isn't it?

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:22.730
Komaki...

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.410
Sure!

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.880
Yeah, of course it is.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.010
Oh, I'm overthinking. I worry too much!

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.210
Thanks, Aoi.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:40.860
But, you know, your grandchildren will
always be watching over you.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.030
Sure...

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.860
You're malnourished.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.730
Have you been getting your rations?

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.270
Well, yes...

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:51.960
Is there anyone here who's injured or can't move?

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:54.430
Is there anyone here...

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:58.740
Is someone there?

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.750
Hey, what the heck happened?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.910
I don't know! I've got no idea!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.580
You're...

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.520
How long has he been like this?

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:15.890
H..He was mugged by some guys last week.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.100
This is out of my league.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.630
Let's take him to the doctor!

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.970
See if you can find something we
could use as a stretcher.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.300
Sagaya?

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.670
Thanks...

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.410
Thanks...

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:41.420
Where is Kisaragi?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.990
There is still disquiet within the Dragon Stream.

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:45.420
Kisaragi Antiques

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.920
Kisaragi Antiques
He set out to resolve the problem,
and it appears he took care of it.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.060
What about the other one?

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:57.260
He says he'll stay, that he's found
a new family in Japan.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:03.740
Hey, everybody, this is Alan's extra-special
dee-licious miso soup!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.840
It's real good for ya! Now eat up!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:06.410
There were mice in it yesterday, right?
It's real good for ya! Now eat up!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:09.610
There were mice in it yesterday, right?
I'd say "dangerous" describes it better
than "delicious".

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.950
Everybody's a connoisseur.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.520
And it really is good too.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:17.750
I made yours extra special, Sera, plenty of meat.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:25.660
I was unable to carry out my mission.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:30.290
And now I am about to go
against your command...

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.400
...to not leave Tokyo.

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.770
I want to protect it.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.480
Not as a Kisaragi,

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.280
but as an individual man...

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.180
...as Hisui Kisaragi.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.290
Kisaragi Antiques

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.090
Kisaragi Antiques
You'll forgive me, won't you, Grandfather?

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:52.390
You'll forgive me, won't you, Grandfather?

00:07:55.990 --> 00:08:01.690
But the power of the Four Divine Guardians is
too great for the body of a human being.

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:05.400
We have no idea how they may react to it.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:12.510
Welcome, welcome! One bowl per person!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:15.640
There's enough for all of you!

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:20.020
I wonder where the little lady went?

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.110
Ow... It hurts!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.250
Wh..White bricks...

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.000
Strawberry curtains...

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:36.130
And a fireplace...

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.210
Tatsuma...

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:43.470
Where are you, Tatsuma?!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.070
Tatsuma!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:57.180
I... I made you strawberry fried...

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.360
Daigo?

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:13.300
Oh, hey, Sakurai, how'd it go?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.610
Takano from Class D says he'll be able to attend.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.410
Is that right?

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:23.780
They say there are people still
buried down in there.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:27.290
There are a lot of people still missing,

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.550
and some you can't identify
even if you do find them.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.090
Please don't worry about me.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.890
I'll be fine.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.930
I'm sorry.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:44.940
Ah, there's no way my old man
bit the dust that easily.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.910
How's your family doing?

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.340
They're already in the temporary shelter.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:50.580
Then, will you also...

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.040
No, I won't be with them.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:59.210
I'm talking with the others about
working at the next shelter.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.650
Is that right?

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:03.680
What are you going to do, Daigo?

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:08.660
I guess I'll go too.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:10.260
Yeah, come along!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:13.030
We'll all be together again, working hard!

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.520
Yes, well, I'll be looking forward
to working with you.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:19.640
I hope we get to see your dad.

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:21.040
Yeah...

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.510
It had been a long time since I'd had
any real conversation with him.

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:26.910
There's a lot I want to talk to him about.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.580
If I don't say this stuff while I can,

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.710
it will probably be too...

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:40.180
I really wanted to become a chef.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:44.730
I did like wrestling too, though.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:46.360
Back when I was in elementary school,

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:50.800
I made some fried eggs for my mom,
who was bedridden and ill.

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:55.040
It made her so happy.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:59.100
She got up out of bed, and we ate them
together in the living room.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:04.400
I can't forget that time, even now.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:09.950
If I ever have a family of my own, it'd be nice to...

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.520
Well, how do I put it? Um...

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:18.430
Sorry, I'm not good with words.

00:11:18.430 --> 00:11:20.830
I don't even know what I'm trying to say!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.630
I understand.

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:26.070
I do understand.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.010
Let's go.

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:34.240
Sure...

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:46.760
My bro told me enough is enough.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.830
Yeah, I heard him too.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.670
Or maybe I'd always heard him saying that.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:55.070
But even so...

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:58.190
It's still not over.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.510
Right, it ain't over yet.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:04.300
This is where it starts.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:07.210
Are you sure?
DELETE
CANCEL

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:16.990
Oh, for crying out loud!
What am I supposed to do?!

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:19.760
Was revenge your intent?

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.760
Yes, it is why I wandered the world.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.600
And then, seventeen years ago in China,

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.170
I came to learn of the Dragon Stream.

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:34.140
Thinking I could make use of it, I came to Japan,

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:38.040
and finally arrived here, at Magami.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.210
This is a mysterious place.

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.910
It's not just the Dragon Stream.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.080
It feels like there is some kind
of great power here.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.480
I don't know what that may be though.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:51.390
But you might...

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:53.760
So, what do you intend to do now?

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:55.390
Huh?

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.390
Oh, I don't know.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.300
There was a time when I hated
the human children.

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.830
I wanted to kill them, so it's...

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.270
It's funny how things turned out.

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:13.580
How all of a sudden I found myself...

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.910
That kind of thing happens a lot.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.120
They say I'm a good teacher because
I understand where they're coming from.

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:21.750
Some of them even come to me for
advice with their love lives!

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.550
It's ridiculous...

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.450
I had them all deceived.

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:31.920
It's too late to apologize to the kids who died.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:37.800
But I want to be with those kids.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:40.340
If they'd only forgive me,

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:44.110
then I'd like to spend my life with them.

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.380
I suppose that's selfish of me.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.500
Yeah, it's selfish.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.280
What will you do?

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.880
Nothing will change for me.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.650
I'll continue to keep watch over this place.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:58.820
That is the promise I made.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.860
Miss Alucard!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:05.020
Could you come to our meeting about
the graduation ceremony?

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:10.570
Your students are calling you, Miss Alucard.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.040
Sure! Coming right away!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.920
Good grief...

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.880
Um, lessee... IV drip, lV drip...

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.590
Oh, Maiko.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.620
Hi there.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.860
Please take breaks when you need to.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:34.930
There are fewer wounded now,

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:39.160
and lately a lot of people are here
only for someone to talk to.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:42.790
A lot of people take their own lives too,
you know?

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:46.000
When the dust finally settles a bit,

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:49.200
people get to thinking about things,
like the future for instance.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.830
If talking will relieve some of the burden,
that's a good thing, right?

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:56.280
Sorry, I didn't...

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.720
Don't worry.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:01.490
As long as there's even one patient,
the doctor won't rest.

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:04.120
So, I won't either.

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:08.490
You know, when I was a little kid,
the doctor saved my life.

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:12.160
So, I can't rest.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:15.660
I want to be like her.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:28.050
Why you low-down, dirty freeloader...

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:31.280
Y..Yes, ma'am! Sorry, ma'am!

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:35.820
Thank you for coming this far with me.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.960
This is the last time we meet.

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:40.660
From now on you shall walk your own paths,

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:43.530
and realize your own ideals of justice.

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:46.330
You shall put your lives on the line.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:48.970
What is it?

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:50.760
Where's Rasetsu?

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.240
A maiden in love is a beautiful thing,

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:56.040
oh naive one.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.240
Stop laughing!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.750
Genma...

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.380
Director...

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:09.110
What about Tatsuma Hiyu?

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.570
Well, I guess I'd better get moving.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:24.060
You'll keep an eye on that guitar
for me, won't you?

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.710
I might be on "tour" a little longer
than usual this time around.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.230
Aw, heck, I'm sure I'll be back
sooner or later though.

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.880
See ya around.

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:41.150
How is he?

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.890
Still the same.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.820
We told him about his parents.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:47.690
I see...

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.360
I am sorry.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.860
Huh?

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:54.670
I raised you in your grandparents' stead,

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:58.140
just to fulfill the mission.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:02.140
I imagine it felt quite unreasonable
to your young hearts.

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.880
I suppose you cursed my name for it.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:06.310
Please, stop.

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:09.010
We never thought any stupid stuff like that!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:12.220
We are grateful to you, Master Arai,

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:16.190
for the way you trained us and guided us.

00:17:16.190 --> 00:17:18.760
Why the heck would we ever hate you?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.630
However...

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.960
Surely, you want to try falling in love?

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:28.730
Wh..What is so funny?

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.440
How out of character that sounded,
coming from you!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:34.640
It's all right, we'll manage to take care of that.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.200
Actually, I've already experienced love.

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:41.040
I see, well, that is good then.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:45.450
We are prepared.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:49.880
Regardless of how many years
or decades it may take.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.860
How foolish...

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:04.970
In the end, the creatures that live in this world
are all like cherry blossoms.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:08.410
They bloom for a short time, then fall,

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:11.500
Ieaving only ugly corpses.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.500
Then...

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.040
I will be...

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.510
...a cherry blossom that does not fall!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:32.360
Would I just get in the way?

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:34.350
I know I would, but...

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:38.190
Hey!

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:42.370
I know where Tatsuma is.

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:45.610
So... So, right now...

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.780
Seems he's in China, on Yagyu's tail.

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:51.020
No! It's too much!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.120
Even if it is Hiyu, he still can't do it alone!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:54.910
I'll go.

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.120
I'm going to go find Tatsuma.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.460
I'll go too.

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:01.190
Wait here! I'll tell Komaki and the others...

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:02.820
No!

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:05.200
Why not?

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:09.170
If you go, what about everyone here?

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:11.900
Or aren't you going to have the
graduation ceremony?

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:15.010
But it's too dangerous for you to go alone!

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:16.010
I'll go with you!

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.910
Forget it! You stay here!

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:20.780
No, I'll go! I'm coming along!

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:22.250
What about everyone that's injured?

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.880
What about everyone in that school building?

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:25.850
Who's gonna protect them?

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:29.020
If you're gone, who the hell
is gonna protect them?

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:32.360
Komaki and the others are here,
and Daigo and Kisaragi too!

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:34.190
Don't you understand, Aoi?

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.820
You're...

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:39.600
Ow...

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:42.530
What? I'm what?

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.330
Tell me exactly what.

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:49.040
You're always like that, covering up
what you really mean.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.440
If you've got something to say,
and you don't say it,

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.110
then how am I supposed to understand?

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.780
I've had enough.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:59.680
How much of this do I have to take? I...

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:01.420
Aoi...

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.420
I can't protect them anymore.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:05.790
I can't fight anymore.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.920
I know! Even if you don't say it, I know!

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.560
But I can't take any more of it!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.900
Everyone's always coming to me.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.630
I can't take responsibility for them anymore.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.970
I'm so tired of it!

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:21.460
I can't stand on my own anymore!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.910
If you go, Kyouichi...

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:27.970
If you go, then who is going to protect me?!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:41.790
Then, stop already.

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:46.530
You don't need to protect anyone anymore.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:48.330
Or fight either.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:52.270
Tell Komaki and the others exactly
what you've just told me.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.740
They won't argue with you either.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:59.240
Yeah, you've done plenty.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:02.180
You've worked your hardest.

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:04.670
You've done enough.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:27.590
Well, see ya!

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:32.740
I'll be waiting for you.

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:38.380
I'll be waiting.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:51.500
Don't go getting in my way, Doom 'n Gloom.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.120
Same to you, simpleton.

00:21:55.700 --> 00:22:00.640
Bloom, fall, bloom, fall...

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:03.510
How many times have I seen this?

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:06.070
Don't you two fall.

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:11.420
What happened to your parents is regrettable.

00:22:11.420 --> 00:22:13.280
In the end...

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:19.120
Ultimately, I wasn't able to show
them my true self.

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:22.660
Tell me, what about him?

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:24.630
He said he'd make me laugh.

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:27.100
He promised me.

00:22:27.100 --> 00:22:29.090
Someday...

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:35.660
Someday, I want to go where he is!

00:22:40.310 --> 00:22:40.840
Magami High School Graduation Ceremony

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:43.510
Magami High School Graduation Ceremony
All right, everyone stand.

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:44.610
Magami High School Graduation Ceremony

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:50.380
I want the graduates whose names
I call to respond loud and clear.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:53.090
Taichi Komagome...

00:22:53.090 --> 00:22:54.330
Here!

00:22:54.330 --> 00:22:56.090
Komaki Sakurai...

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:57.430
Here!

00:22:57.430 --> 00:22:59.230
Yuuya Daigo...

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:00.730
Here!

00:23:00.730 --> 00:23:02.570
Kazumi Seijo...

00:23:02.570 --> 00:23:03.770
Here!

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:05.500
Kyouko Tohno...

00:23:05.500 --> 00:23:07.070
Here!

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:08.970
Mamoru Gojiya...

00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:10.140
Here!

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:12.110
Go Oyaguchi...

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:13.210
Here!

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:14.850
Aoi Misato...

00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:16.470
Here!

00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:18.920
Damn, I'm hungry...

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:23.180
Just how far does that bastard plan on going?

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:25.590
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:26.920
Here!

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:28.930
Kyouichi Houraiji...

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:30.550
Here!

00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:39.500
Kyouichi...

00:23:40.570 --> 00:23:42.200
Tatsuma!

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:51.910
Oh, yeah?

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.420
Oh, well, what else can I do?

00:23:57.420 --> 00:23:59.820
You just wait for me, sleepyhead.

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:03.420
Cuz I'm coming to wake your ass up!

